  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Central Continent Gu Immortal talk pairs her with Chen Zhen Chi in the saying Zhen Chi of the nine heavens, followed by Fei Yan. The Fei Yan half names her as a Heavenly Lotus Sect Gu Immortal who moves agilely in the sky like a wisp of smoke dancing in the air. She comes to Northern Plains representing Heavenly Lotus Sect among the ten great ancient sects to investigate the collapse of Eighty-Eight True Yang Building. With Chen Zhen Chi present, two flying grandmasters of the current generation are on the scene. Chen Zhen Chi speaks while she remains silent.",
      "chapters": [
        811
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
